1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Simeon Karl Eugen Josef Leopold Erzherzog von Österreich''' was born on 29 June 1958 at Katana, Belgian Congo. He is the son of Rudolf Syringus Erzherzog von Österreich and Kseniya Sergeievna Besobrasova. He mar
2 CONC ried Maria Paloma Diana Irene di Borbone, Principessa di Borbone delle Due Sicilie, daughter of Carlos di Borbone, Duca di Calabria and Anne Marguerite Brigitte Marie d'Orléans, Princesse de France, on 13 July 1996 at La Toledana,
2 CONC  Spain.
