2 CONT     * Cressida, Troilus and Cressida, Royal Shakespeare Company, AldwychTheatre, London, 1968
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Hero, Much Ado about Nothing, Aldwych Theatre, 1968–1969
2 CONT
